{
  "name": "agent-loop-sidecar-stdio-tool",
  "about": "PILOTDECK_AGENT_LOOP_TRANSPORT=stdio 下带工具调用的轮次：第一轮 read_file 读项目文件再 bash 一次（宿主侧执行工具，sidecar 只经 module_call 调用），第二轮同会话纯文本（新 turnId，新的一组 agent_loop_operation_* 记录，modelState 从上一轮带入 execute）。比较帧、发给 provider 的请求与会话 .jsonl 里 agent_loop_operation_started / accepted / terminal 的位置与字段（terminal 的 lastAppliedSequence、seedState 里宿主的读文件检查点）。src/agent/modules/transport/agentLoopSidecarClient.ts:586-632、780-798、1053-1072，sessionOperationLedger.ts:52-130。标题请求延迟 4 秒、首轮后等 5 秒，让标题记录稳定落在首轮之后（sidecar 起动快慢不同，标题与 agent_loop_operation_started 的先后在两侧会不同）。",
  "volatile": ["\\.jsonl\\[\\d+\\]\\.binding\\.(moduleInstanceId|connectionGeneration)$", "\\.jsonl\\[\\d+\\]\\.streamId$"],
  "env": {
    "PILOTDECK_AGENT_LOOP_TRANSPORT": "stdio"
  },
  "files": {
    "proj/notes.txt": "alpha\nbeta\n"
  },
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\": \"Sidecar tool\"}",
        "delayMs": 4000
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "second",
      "when": [
        "sc-two:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Second turn done."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "after-bash",
      "when": [
        "sc-one:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_sc_bash\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Tools done."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "after-read",
      "when": [
        "sc-one:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_sc_read\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_sc_bash",
          "name": "bash",
          "arguments": {
            "command": "echo from-bash"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "first",
      "when": [
        "sc-one:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_sc_read",
          "name": "read_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "{PROJECT}/notes.txt"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "ws": "set_permission_mode",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-sc-tool",
        "mode": "bypassPermissions"
      }
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-sc-tool",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "sc-one: read and run"
      },
      "timeout": 60000
    },
    {
      "sleep": 5000
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-sc-tool",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "sc-two: again"
      },
      "timeout": 60000
    }
  ]
}
